-      "description": "Malaysia's amended PDPA (Phase 3, June 2025) mandates that data controllers notify the Personal Data Protection Commissioner within 72 hours of discovering a qualifying breach, and notify affected data subjects within 7 days. Rainbow AI stores WhatsApp message history and guest personal data, requiring a documented breach response workflow.",
